      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is a full-body reference of the same young anime-style woman in a dark red dress.\n<Picture 2> is an upper-body reference of the same young anime-style woman in a dark camisole and loungewear.\n<Picture 3> is a face close-up reference of the same young anime-style woman in a school uniform blazer.\n\n<Subject 1> is the exact same young anime-style woman consistently defined across <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>, and <Picture 3>: she has dark hair tied in a neat low bun updo, soft bangs, delicate side strands framing her face, expressive gray-violet eyes, fair porcelain skin, and a bright cute smile.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] 2D anime-style animation. The scene takes place in a dance studio with a smooth polished wooden floor and a mirrored wall in the background. <Subject 1> performs an energetic full-body dance, stepping rhythmically, moving her arms expressively to the music, smiling with charm, turning her body, and striking dynamic dance poses. The camera stays static in a clean full-body framing, clearly showing her coordinated footwork and dance movements throughout the shot.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nEnergetic dance footsteps and subtle ambient acoustics inside a spacious dance studio.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nUpbeat, cheerful, and rhythmic pop dance music with a clear beat suitable for dance practice.",
